those whose hearts

1042
00:46:10,220 --> 00:46:11,280
are fully committed

1043
00:46:11,280 --> 00:46:11,800
to him.

1044
00:46:11,800 --> 00:46:13,520
You wanna be a part

1045
00:46:13,520 --> 00:46:15,860
of cultivating

1046
00:46:15,860 --> 00:46:16,440
God's kingdom

1047
00:46:16,440 --> 00:46:16,880
on earth

1048
00:46:16,880 --> 00:46:17,700
as it is in heaven?

1049
00:46:17,700 --> 00:46:20,440
Surrender your heart

1050
00:46:20,440 --> 00:46:21,200
fully to him.

1051
00:46:21,200 --> 00:46:23,360
And I think

1052
00:46:23,360 --> 00:46:24,320
he'll blow you away

1053
00:46:24,320 --> 00:46:25,060
with what he can do

1054
00:46:25,060 --> 00:46:25,380
with it.

1055
00:46:27,480 --> 00:46:28,940
This chapter reminds us

1056
00:46:28,940 --> 00:46:29,620
that our everyday

1057
00:46:29,620 --> 00:46:30,580
ordinary lives

1058
00:46:30,580 --> 00:46:31,300
are charged

1059
00:46:31,300 --> 00:46:33,040
with redemptive potential

1060
00:46:33,040 --> 00:46:34,220
if only we have eyes

1061
00:46:34,220 --> 00:46:34,600
to see.

1062
00:46:34,600 --> 00:46:35,960
Boaz thought

1063
00:46:35,960 --> 00:46:36,660
he was waking up

1064
00:46:36,660 --> 00:46:37,780
to the daily grind

1065
00:46:37,780 --> 00:46:38,760
of the nine to five,

1066
00:46:38,760 --> 00:46:40,540
but God had different plans.

1067
00:46:40,540 --> 00:46:42,200
Ruth thought

1068
00:46:42,200 --> 00:46:42,900
she was just trying

1069
00:46:42,900 --> 00:46:44,180
to survive one more day,

1070
00:46:44,180 --> 00:46:46,420
but God had different plans.

1071
00:46:46,420 --> 00:46:48,780
How might this testimony

1072
00:46:48,780 --> 00:46:49,920
invite us to see

1073
00:46:49,920 --> 00:46:50,640
and participate

1074
00:46:50,640 --> 00:46:51,880
in his redemptive work

1075
00:46:51,880 --> 00:46:53,240
in our everyday lives?

1076
00:46:54,440 --> 00:46:55,040
Whether we're

1077
00:46:55,040 --> 00:46:56,100
a wealthy business owner,

1078
00:46:56,100 --> 00:46:57,180
a first grade teacher,

1079
00:46:57,180 --> 00:46:58,180
a physical therapist,

1080
00:46:58,180 --> 00:46:59,340
a government contractor,

1081
00:46:59,340 --> 00:47:00,460
or a stay-at-home mom,

1082
00:47:00,460 --> 00:47:01,180
how might God

1083
00:47:01,180 --> 00:47:03,420
use your daily life,

1084
00:47:03,420 --> 00:47:05,020
surrendered to him,

1085
00:47:05,020 --> 00:47:06,220
submitted to him,

1086
00:47:06,220 --> 00:47:07,000
to bring about

1087
00:47:07,000 --> 00:47:08,080
his redemptive work

1088
00:47:08,080 --> 00:47:08,800
in your life

1089
00:47:08,800 --> 00:47:09,520
and in the life

1090
00:47:09,520 --> 00:47:10,340
of those around you?

1091
00:47:10,340 --> 00:47:12,880
Like I said

1092
00:47:12,880 --> 00:47:14,180
at the start

1093
00:47:14,180 --> 00:47:14,960
of our time together,

1094
00:47:14,960 --> 00:47:15,840
I don't imagine

1095
00:47:15,840 --> 00:47:16,420
you'll remember

1096
00:47:16,420 --> 00:47:17,660
much of what I said

1097
00:47:17,660 --> 00:47:18,520
past Monday morning,

1098
00:47:18,520 --> 00:47:20,980
but I truly believe

1099
00:47:20,980 --> 00:47:21,600
that if you get

1100
00:47:21,600 --> 00:47:22,700
the story of Ruth

1101
00:47:22,700 --> 00:47:24,100
and the story

1102
00:47:24,100 --> 00:47:24,900
of the whole Bible

1103
00:47:24,900 --> 00:47:25,740
into your heart

1104
00:47:25,740 --> 00:47:26,840
and into your imagination,

1105
00:47:26,840 --> 00:47:27,860
it has the power

1106
00:47:27,860 --> 00:47:29,280
to change everything

1107
00:47:29,280 --> 00:47:29,960
that you do

1108
00:47:29,960 --> 00:47:31,920
from now until eternity.

1109
00:47:31,920 --> 00:47:33,240
Let's pray.
